   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-nNJaW5Vse4o/UCAV3lrjIlI/AAAAAAAAAD0/9EOyzqxoWG4/s1600/y-axis-scale-20120807.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-nNJaW5Vse4o/UCAV3lrjIlI/AAAAAAAAAD0/9EOyzqxoWG4/s1600/y-axis-scale-20120807.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238962552000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tcV-hK1pwVgyV8k9Jn983\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-nNJaW5Vse4o/UCAV3lrjIlI/AAAAAAAAAD0/9EOyzqxoWG4/s320/y-axis-scale-20120807.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"295\"></a></p><div>1. 主要在plot之中可加上 xaxs = &quot;i&quot; 指令並設定刻度範圍, 查詢指令 </div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>?par</b></font></div><div><br></div><div>2. <b style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">legend(0, max(x,y,y)*0.95</b><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><font color=\"#000000\"> 應該是改為 *0.95, 否則會超過最上端</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div>3. 完整程式碼如下:<div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># Title: y-axis scale</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># Date: 2012.8.7</b></font></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>par(mar=c(5, 4, 4, 4) + 0.1)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>r=seq(-0.3,0.3,by = 0.1)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>x=c(0.0,0.05,0.1,0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>y=c(5.9,3.1,2.2,1.7,1.4,1.3,1.2)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>par(mar=c(5.1, 4.1, 3, 10),xpd=TRUE)</b></font></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>plot(r,x,pch=13,cex=1.4,type=&quot;b&quot;,ylim=c(0.0,1.0), xlim=c(-0.3,0.3),col=&quot;black&quot;,axes=F, xaxs = &quot;i&quot;, yaxs=&quot;i&quot;)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>axis(side=1,at=seq(-0.3,0.3,0.2))</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>axis(2,ylim=c(0,1.0))</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>box()</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>par(new=T)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>plot(r,y,pch=14,cex=1.4,xlab=&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;&quot;,axes=F, ylim=c(1,6),type=&quot;b&quot;,col=&quot;red&quot;, xaxs = &quot;i&quot;, yaxs=&quot;i&quot;)</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>axis(4,ylim=c(1,6))</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>legend(0, max(x,y,y)*0.95, legend=c(&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;), pch=c(13:14), text.col=c(&quot;black&quot;,&quot;red&quot;), col=c(&quot;black&quot;,&quot;red&quot;))</b></font></div><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b># end</b></font></div></div>"
